      "w": 520,
      "size": "m",
      "fill": "gray",
      "text": "One payment layout for card, bank transfer and manual transfer: ticket, breakdown, deadline banner, then one bank-details card (no card inside a card). Manual bank transfer stays an option (ADR 0090)."
    },
    "amountDecision": {
      "x": -620,
      "y": 7820,
      "w": 520,
      "size": "m",
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "OPEN DECISION (not resolved here): 'Amount due now' means ₦390,000 (stay + deposit) on the payment choice screen, but ₦370,000 (the stay payment alone) on the transfer screens. 'Amount paid' on confirmation also shows the stay payment only. These screens show today's values; pick one meaning before build."
    },
